OL,3,GNEWSAEight weeks of roadworks for
OL,4,ACambridge gas works
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral roads in Cambridge will be
OL,7,Fclosed or face disruption because of
OL,8,Fgas works expected to last about eight
OL,9,Fweeks.
OL,11,FCadent Gas, which will carry out the
OL,12,Fwork, said 650m (2132ft) of gas pipe on
OL,13,FHills Road, between Cavendish Avenue
OL,14,Fand Holbrook Road, needed replacing.
OL,15,FWork is expected to start on Monday and
OL,16,Ffinish on 27 November.
OL,18,FIt said replacements would result in
OL,19,Ftemporary traffic lights along Hills
OL,20,FRoad and side roads would close.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
